msgstr "RPCS3 中的光碟是 ISO 檔，%ls：請開啟它（掛接），將全部內容複製到一個資料夾，再用「瀏覽」前往該資料夾"

#: game_find.cpp:303
msgid "The disc's files in %ls are encrypted: a dump never decrypted. A decrypted copy is needed"
msgstr "%ls 中的光碟檔案已加密：這是從未解密過的傾印。需要解密過的副本"

#: game_find.cpp:311
msgid "Not every update is installed: %d file missing, %hs first. Install 1.04 to 1.12, in order"
msgstr "並非所有更新都已安裝：缺少 %d 個檔案，第一個是 %hs。請依序安裝 1.04 到 1.12"

#: game_find.cpp:312
msgid "Not every update is installed: %d files missing, %hs first. Install 1.04 to 1.12, in order"
msgstr "並非所有更新都已安裝：缺少 %d 個檔案，第一個是 %hs。請依序安裝 1.04 到 1.12"

#: game_find.cpp:315
msgid "Not every update is installed: %d file differs, %hs first. Install 1.04 to 1.12, in order"
msgstr "並非所有更新都已安裝：有 %d 個檔案不符，第一個是 %hs。請依序安裝 1.04 到 1.12"

#: game_find.cpp:316
msgid "Not every update is installed: %d files differ, %hs first. Install 1.04 to 1.12, in order"
msgstr "並非所有更新都已安裝：有 %d 個檔案不符，第一個是 %hs。請依序安裝 1.04 到 1.12"

#: game_find.cpp:321
msgid "Not the whole disc: %d of the game's %d files missing (%ls), %hs first. Copy all of the disc again"
msgstr "光碟不完整：缺少 %d 個遊戲檔案（共 %d 個，%ls），第一個是 %hs。請重新複製整張光碟"

#: game_find.cpp:326
msgid "Not the whole game: %d of its %d files missing (%ls), %hs first. Install the game again"
msgstr "遊戲不完整：缺少 %d 個檔案（共 %d 個，%ls），第一個是 %hs。請重新安裝遊戲"

#: game_find.cpp:329
msgid "%d of the disc's files is not as the disc has it, %hs first. Copy all of the disc again"
msgstr "有 %d 個檔案與光碟上的不同，第一個是 %hs。請重新複製整張光碟"

#: game_find.cpp:330
msgid "%d of the disc's files are not as the disc has them, %hs first. Copy all of the disc again"
msgstr "有 %d 個檔案與光碟上的不同，第一個是 %hs。請重新複製整張光碟"

#: game_find.cpp:333
msgid "%d of the game's files is not as version 1.12 has it, %hs first. Install the game again"
msgstr "有 %d 個遊戲檔案與 1.12 版的不同，第一個是 %hs。請重新安裝遊戲"

#: game_find.cpp:334
msgid "%d of the game's files are not as version 1.12 has them, %hs first. Install the game again"
msgstr "有 %d 個遊戲檔案與 1.12 版的不同，第一個是 %hs。請重新安裝遊戲"

